  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Local Elections</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of this project is to contribute to a transparent, inclusive, and peaceful electoral process by supporting the institutions responsible for election management. The project provides the support to the electoral commission (ANE) and other stakeholders to address gaps in transparency, inclusion, and responsible leadership for credible elections. It enhances both the institutional and technical capacities of electoral bodies in CAR.</narrative>
  </description>
